---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Platen terms of service (draft stub)."
  canonicalPath="/terms"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Draft stub — replace with legal review before public signup.</p>
    <div class="mt-10 space-y-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        These Terms govern use of Platen’s websites and services. By creating an account or using the
        platform, you agree to these Terms.
      </p>
      <p>
        Platen provides digital menu software for restaurants. Free plans include documented limits.
        We may update features, limits, and these Terms; material changes will be communicated when
        accounts are live.
      </p>
      <p>
        You are responsible for content you publish (menus, images, prices) and for complying with
        applicable law in your jurisdiction.
      </p>
      <p>
        Contact: support details will be published with the production launch.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
